na anyaṣāṃ liṅgadūṣībhavati ||

tasminbhage anyaśe phana praviśati ||

gṛdve netra aṃjanavimiśreṇa mājāraraktena saha aṃjanaṃ pretapiśācaṃ 
darśayeti || 

svaśiṣyaṣu pradātavyaṃ nānyaṣāṃ ca kadācana |
tenāpi hi pradātavyā adhikārāyaśāstrataḥ ||

oṃ hrīṁ pheṁ guhyakālike phaṭ phreṁ hūṃ namaḥ ||

aiṃ śrīṁ hskhphreṁ hūṁ ya(**?) hūṁ śirasi (4) ||

aiṃ śrīṁ phreṁ bhairavāya haiṁ hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ || śikhā ||

aiṁ śrīṁ haiṁ mṛtyu hūṃ phaṭ namaḥ || netra ||

aiṁ śrīṁ phreṁ hūṃ mahāmṛtyu phaṭ phreṁ namaḥ || vaktre || 

aiṁ śrīṁ hskhphreṁ huṃ yamāya phreṁ namaḥ || hṛdayeḥ || 

oṃ śrī hreṃ kamāya hūṃ phreṃ phaṭ namaḥ ||

ku kṣauṁ || aiṃ hrīṁ phreṁ mahākālāya huṁ phreṁ phaṭ namaḥ || jaṃghayo ||

<p. 19a> oṃ śrī hrīṁ nandine phreṁ hūṃ namaḥ || pādayoḥ || 

oṃ śrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ hiri (2) kici (2) huṃ phreṁ namaḥ || kavaca || 

aiṁ hrī phreṁ śrīṁ yamadaṇḍe phreṁ haiṁ huṁ phaṭ namaḥ || gaḍayoḥ(?) ||

aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ kṣayadaṇḍe phreṁ huṃ phaṭ namaḥ || hastayoḥ || 

aiṁ hūṃ phreṁ phreṁ namaḥ || astra || 

aiṁ phreṁ phaṭ hūṃ caṇḍe hūṃ phreṁ namaḥ || aṃgulyāṃ ||

aiṁ hrīṁ hūṁ caṇḍikāyai hrīṁ (2) phreṁ phreṁ (2) phreṁ phaṭ namaḥ || mṛtyuṃjaya || 

icchayā sādhane || 

mokṣayādbhāvamārgeṇa bhāvabhāvaśca mokṣadam || 
arddhamātrā sāvarambanirārambaṃ bhageśvaram ||

nīlakarpaṭena mukhamācchādya preveśayet || 
atha tena puṣpaprakṣipyāpayet ||

athavā prāṅmukhaḥ || asaṃke ca sasaṃkrāyākauravāmekayā ||

<p. 19b> atha samayavidyā ||

oṃ namaḥ cāmuṇḍe pracaṇḍe phetkāriṇī (2) duhi (2) phaṭ jālandhare 
mahālakṣmīcaritre vārāhī nagaleccetradurvāsinī karṇakubje mahākarṇī 
aṣṭamātarī māheśvarī brahmāṇī vaiṣṇavī indrāṇī kaumārī vārāhī 
māhendrī cāmuṇḍā mahālakṣmī śrīsiddhilakṣmībhairavī guhya 
śrīmahākālī māye mahāmāye sarvasiddhiṃ dada sarvasaṃsāratāriṇī 
devīkoṭakāmarūpavāsinī śmasānabhairavaprīyasamarasadvaitācāra priya hrīṁ 
huṃ phaṭ svāhā || 

aiṁ phreṁ huṁ hrīṁ cuṁ strīṁ śrīṁ kici (2) kili (2) hana (2) <p. 20a> daha (2) grasa (2) he (2) hreṁ 
siddhibhairavī sarvayoginīnāṃ samarasakāriṇī trailokavāsinī 
sarvagataviṣamadurgamavanaparvatavāsinī saṃgrāmavāsinī jaye vijaye prade 
paṭhe yathopavāsinī vṛkṣe vṛkṣopavāsinī sarve sarvagate jaye jayati ajite aparājite 
chrīṁ strīṁ staraṇī pūriṇī hrīṁ namaḥ samasamayati dviprabhavati pravisati khphreṁ 
khreṁ chrīṁ strīṁ vūṁ phreṁ namaḥ svāhā | eṣā sarvayoginīnāṃ samayavidyā || 
hūṁ || 

bhairavasahitatrailokyamāte hreṁ ceṁ cheṁ namaḥ svāhā || āsā sarvayoginīnāṃ 
samayavidyā || 

bhairavabhairavīnāṃ sarvasiddhināṃ <p. 20b> sarvaśākinīnāṃ sarveṣāṃ 
samayavidyeti || anayā uccāritena sarvayoginīnā sarvadevānāṃ 
vidyādharādīnāṃ yakṣādīnāṃ sarvakṣātropapīṭhe kṣetre ca sarvatramānyo 
bhavati || sarvatraivaktrāyate || sarvatrā vaddho sarvapāpavinirmukto bhavati || ||

jihvāllollaphetkāra  da da hāhākārapūjāvasāne devīnāṃ candane samayakāle 
|| citte cittaṃ saṃbhave cchiraṃ loṭayet || hṛṣṭapuṣṭasarvatra maule yā trisaṃdhyā 
jāpayet || devasthāne manasā hūṁ phreṁ uccārayet || tuṣṭā bhavati | anena samaye 
vidyayāmicchati || taṃ karoti ||

devyāyā prathamaṃ maṃtrasadyaḥ prokṣita mahāśaṃkhasūtramālayā 
tṛsaṃdhyaṃ japet || aṣṭaviṃsatijāpyanasiddhyati || || 

sarvamaṃtrāḥ sidhyanti || śmaśānadagdhakativāsakṛte jāpyena pratyakṣaṃ yāti 
|| kruddhena pātayantī || devyai nivedya || tena mahāmokṣo bhavati || udakaṃ japtvā 
saṃharati tena nipātyate || yena sevyatra nayamicchati || śmasānāṃgāreṇa 
śatajāpyena yaṃ hanati || śmasānā bhasmanāvāsā kṛjaptena vāhanet || te sarve 
mṛtavanniśceṣṭā bhavati || yena sevitena ca micchati || śmasānāṃgāreṇa 
śatajāpena jāhanati mūrcchitā bhavanti || smaśānabhasmena vāsakṛjjaptvā 
hanet || sarve te mṛtavanniśceṣṭā bhavati || devyā hṛdayena siṃcet svaṣṭho bhavati 
|| <p. 21b> yathā bhairavastathā sakaroti || vāmena sarvakarmaṃ dakṣiṇe (*)(?) || eṣā 
bhagavati siddhidā icchārūpaṃ karoti || mahābhairava ca svayaṃ bhavet || 
jarāmaravacca jarāmaraṇavarjito bhavati || sarvavyādhivinirmuktoḥ 
sarvadoṣavivarjitaḥ || agnivatsarvaśatrūn tāpayati || kāryā kāryaṃ pṛchati || 
khaḍgapādukājena gutikāṃ vāsitvasiddhyati || nānārasarasāyanādyaṣṭasiddhi 
nānāvidhānekakṣudrasiddhisadhayati || nāsaukenāpi vadhyate || 
satatajāpyanamanasāyamicchati taṃ karoti || anunukaṃ pārajīvājvarī nāśayati || 
vairiṇaṃ jvareṇa gṛhnāpayati || va ca sāmātreṇa sarvaṃ gṛhnāti || <p. 22a> kiṃ 
vahunāti || kiṃ vahunā ājñāsiddhi || bhavati || hṛdayambā sarvasiddhi sarvemantro 
sarvakāryāṇi kurvantī || tasya śmasāne siddhi sati mūlamantreṇa siddhyate 
trailokyaṃ siddhyati || pheṁ valindadet || labhed bhairavajñānaśca tridaśairapi 
durlabham || anena jñānamātreṇa devatāvitprati svayam || pralayasṛṣṭikāro bhavati 
|| jāpyameva sadākāryā yogindrairapi tiṣṭhan bhuṃjan pivan svayaṃ maithunepi 
mānasajāpaṃ na tyajet || taṃ dṛkṣvā mohitā sarvejanamohitā bhavati || rātrau 
sadā japet || uddiśya śarīrā bhavanti || kumārīnāṃ sadā pūjā kuryādyathā 
vibhavaśaktinā | tato siddhiyoginīnāṃ bhavati ca striyāṃ yadi siddhiṃ samīhate || 
<p. 22b> meghaṃ staṃbhayati || sphoṭā vayati ājñāyāṃ devaṃ dharmāpayati || 
ādityaṃ vārayati || aṇenasiddhiṃ bhavati || sa yogi bhairavasvayam || avaśyaṃ 
siddhyate devī bhairavaśca sadā sthite | nānyathā siddhimāpnoti devenāpi 
kadācana || eya mantreśvarorājā mantrāṇāṃ pretanāyaka | prāpayiṣyanti 
devyāstu putrastu nānyante viḍaṃvakāḥ || yathāstu gṛhnate devī śāvyavinā 
prāpyate | narasyāvasyamaraṇaṃ yātrasahasrake | anāvikṛtopi vā yaḥ praṇata 
aparaṃ paramamatanuṃ devyā yā guhyamuttamam | mukhena siddhyate śauce 
mantroccāravidhānatā bhairavaśca mahābhāgā hrīṁ cchrī cūṁ devyā hṛdayaṃ 
pratyekaṃ ca maheśvarī ||

<p. 23a> oṃ namo bhairavī prathamaṃ devī kṣobhiṇī ca dvitīyakam || 
mahāpralayakāriśca tṛtīyaṃ marmameva ca || 
marmābhighāteti padaṃ caturthastu padaṃ likhet | 

paṃcamaṃ kili kili tyava kici kici padaṃ tata hrīṁ chrīṁ amukaṃ kāryameva kuru (2) 
svāhā || ||

oṃ namo hrīṁ khphreṁ hūṃ phreṁ bhairavī kṣobhinī mahāpralayakāriṇī 
marmamarmābhighāte kili (2) kici (2) hrīṁ chrīṁ amukakāryame kuru (2) svāhā || 

ityukto mantradaivadurlabham || anena siddhyate vaśyaṃ trailokyaṃ sacarācaram | 
trimuccārita vidyā nityaṃ saṃdhyājāpya daśasahasrāṇi mahāsamahāsamayaṃ 
kṛtvā gurupūjāparāyaṇam || <p. 23b> tena siddhi prajāyate || tataḥ pūrvasūcitā 
kāryaṃ karoti || sakṛduccārite naiva sarvalokāvaśaṃkarī || pūrvoktasarvaṃ karoti 
|| 

phreṁ huṃ huṃ phaṭ svāhāḥ || 

anuktā tyaktayāḥ śrūyate || kruddho japyasādhayataḥ || yaṃ icchati taṃ karoti || 
jvaladāhe śūlena udvejayati || tadā hṛti pādādṛṣṭi gṛhagṛhnāti || 
manasāyāpetayamicchaṃti taṃ karoti || prakṛtinā saṅgṛhereti dayati || 
dviṣaṃḍāṃ karoti || 

icchayā bhagavati siddhā advaitabhairavī tripurāntagā || 
karoti sarvakarmāścāyante cchati manasā sthitā | mantrān dṛḍhavratān śrutvā 
<p. 24a> bhairavāyā(?)nusāriṇāṃḥ || 

anyaṣāṃ vai nadātavyā bhairavājñāṃ vinā tathā || vicaredvai trailokeṣu 
lokānvai pūrayāt sadā || 

athānyat saṃpravakṣyāmi sadāsiddhipradā śivā || yasya cchayā pravartante 
jñānabhairavabhīṣitam | manasāvarjanīye nakṛṣṇaṃ tadīnaśca nirīkṣyate || 
kopināneśanaṃ bhuktvā natṛkāṃ vāpi tiṣṭhate || paraiḥ saha || evaṃ te kathitaṃ 
jñātvā dravyahaste tato siddhe raktanī sahacarā gṛdhraśiraṃ ca viśeṣataḥ || 
śivaṃ jñānasamanvitam | aṃjayet netrayugalam || sarveṣām || 
vāmanetravimiśritāḥ || saptapātālaṃ pravisati || icchārūpaṃ karoti || 
parameśvaraḥ || athavā gulike || <p. 24b> ramaṃtatvadullabho yogasaṃravā || asya 
bhāvanamātreṇa sarvajñatvaṃ prayacchati || devīkāyā tu tallakṣayā 
siddhikāraṇahetavāyeṇa guptāguptenaste vījākhyaṃ parameśvarī 
śirīrayogeṣṭottamam || ekā vai yadivā sarve tadā kiṃ namaste namaskāreṇa 
asiddhe nāpi prakartavyam || anahyetā parityajet || ||

	oṃ phreṁ hūṁ guhyakālī hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ || 

hiṃsakāsarvopadravān tantramantrayogāḥ khphreṁ hara (2) hūṃ phaṭ 
draṣṭākalālī phreṁ phaṭ namaḥ svāhā || 

pratyaṃgirā siddhimukhī vidyāvāratrayaṃ smaret || yantraduhyāṭayati || vipatau 
saṃkaṭe ripukṣayabhayaraṇe smaraṇāt siddhirbhavati || na kiṃcit prabhavati tasya 
jāpī maheśvaraḥ || <p. 25a> aṇena prokṣaṇaṃ kṛtvā bhakṣabhojyaṃ ca 
kartavyaṃ nabhī || tathāparaṃ pūṣpadhūpaṃ datvā dhyānaṃ paṭhanam || 
adhikārapūjāmaṣṭamyāṃ caturdaśyāṃ na yasyāṃ nityapūjā || 
adhikaparvapūjā aṣṭamī navamī caturdaśī saṃkrāntī pūrṇimā kuhukujavāreti 
mahāsiddhirbhavati | jvaragrahāriṣṭa smaraṇamātraṇa syati || ||

śrībhairava uvāca || 

yamuddiśya mahāsamayaṃ kṛtvā paṭhet || etat te kālikāyā paramajñānaṃ 
prāṇātyadhikaṃ priya || gopitavyamidaṃ siddhi sarvakāryaparāyaṇaiḥ || ||

athocyate karmabhedaṃ viśeṣaṃ parameśvarī || 
yogavijñātamātreṇa yo tridaśahā bhavet ||
<p. 25b> ubhayostanauparihastayocchalanaśiraḥ | hastatarayo pūrvabhruve nākāvāse 
nāsikāgre kaṇṭhe ca udare || nābhau pādāṃguṣṭhe mūlatayo ubhayapārśveṣu 
mūrdhnipṛṣṭhavādvairocayoḥ || ṭeṭīke jihvāmūle ca rantalaṅgulamūle 
puṣpādaśirataḥ || etānmarmapradeśāni mātraśo vasate śivaḥ tata sparśayet || 
acaṃcalayoḥ liṃga(-)udare gude sarvasandhiṣu paramarmasaṃcarati 
nābhigrīvaviṣaṇe hṛdaye ca sadā deva tiṣṭhati | paramaśivam | karṇacalatale 
grīvāṃse kapolayoḥ marma bhramate sadā || ||

aiṁ draṃṣṭākalāli aiṁ hūṃ phreṁ marmamarmābhi <p. 27a> phreṁ hana (2) hanaḥ (4) 
hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || 

sarvaśmasānād bhava kena svarṇa (*)(?) to marmābhipātena vā trisaṃdhyāṃ 
jāpyaṃ ṣoḍaśāṃgulasamavistaram || pādayāti sarvato 
urddhaprajāmantrākramādravya tu rakṣayet || aṃgulyā dvāṃgula dvi (*)(?) 
caturakramaśaḥ | arddhāgulyapatrapaladravyam | suvarṇahṛṣṭatuṣṭa 
sphītasudhāraśca || aṃgulya na paṃcapalāstalā | arddhārddhikena paṃcapalā | 
dvā dvādaśaḥ krama atitvaritāḥ saṇḍaṭhilāḥ avaṅgiṇaḥ || 
dravyamaṃgulyādaṃgulyā hṛtvā aṃśakena haredbhāgam | 
aṃgulyādaṃgulāṃ kṛtvā svakareṇa haredbhāgam || śeṣadravyaṃ tathā 
viśeṣagaṇitaśivalocanau || <p. 27b> gṛddhraviḍālalocanau ulūkaśiraṃ dagdhā 
sarvāṃjaneṣu bhāvayet || ||

hṛdayamantreṇa jāpyena aṃjayennetrayugalam || naratailaśubhāvitena || 
aṃjitamātreṇa janmo bhavān gālikān dravyasaṃkhyā pramāṇaṃ paśyaṃti 
adṛśyo bhavati || siddhi yāgoyaṃ icchayā sarvaṃ bhavati || ||

dhyānayoga ||

māraṇe kṛṣṇarūṣī ca vaśyaraktaprakīrtitam | 
uccāṭe dhūmravarṇaṃ ca śānte śubhrā prakīrtitā || 

staṃbhaṇe pītavarṇaṃ ca icchārūpaṃ maheśvarī || etat paramaguhyaṃ ca 
tatvanirṇayameva ca || ||

oṃ phreṃ siddhi kalāli hrīṁ cchrīṁ hūṁ strīṁ phreṁ namaḥ svāhā | 

eṣā sā paramādevi japitavyaṃ sadā budhaiḥ ||
<p. 28a> sarvakarmāṇi siddhyanti manasā cintayeni vai | 

punaḥ kākathā cintaguhyayogena siddhi yogīśvarī karoti || yoginīmelāpaṃ karoti 
|| sarvasusvapnadarśayati || yoginīmelakaṃ caiva svayameva prajāyate || 
aṇenakāryaṃ sarvaṃ karoti || icchāsiddhi cittavācā bhavati || nānārūpī 
sabdaducāraṇena prāsaye siddhigocalā bhavati || yoginīmelāpaṃ karoti | 
sarvasusvapna darśayati śivarūpaṃ paśyati || sarvayoginī devyādyāstadā 
guhyahṛdayena raktavaliṃ datvā madhyamaṇḍalaṃ vidhāyalekhya bhairavayogine || 
nānyena kadācane || kumārīko avadhāropayati || <p. 28b> guhyapradeśe likhitavyā 
madyaprāsanena || paramaguhyahṛdayena raktena valindatvā hṛdayena 
hrīṁkārāntena paṃcāmṛtena śodhayet || madyādya sarvadravyaṃ gatvākṛṣṭiṃ 
karoti paramantrān cchedayati || teṣāṃ mantrāṇāṃ dāraṇāsatrā rādhitā 
bhavati || anenamantreṇa adhikārān dāpayet | svaśikhya adhikārān datvā || ||

vācayet paṭhati ||

sakulāṃ vimalakena narakaṃ na paśyat | hṛdaye jāpena sarvabhutā paśyati || 
yamicchati taṃ karoti | gurościttavṛttiṃ kārayet sarvasiddhikāraṇe nāsya tatra 
taṃtreśvaro bhavet || yoginīnāṃ taṃtra prāyānām || <p. 29a> kuru ḍi ḍāṃ kṣo (*) 
(*)(?) tre advaitahṛdisaṃsthite || etadvai paramaṃ jñānaṃ tavadeva(?) prakīrtitam || 
nānyase ca mayādattaṃ guhya vai paramaṃ śive || devyā paśyantu tatpuṇya 
bhāgyā nānyā tu vidyate || bhairavāvasthitaṃ yatra sakṛsmaraṇādasya karoti || 
icchayā yāgīnībharavī guhyakālīkā sarvatatvā paṃcatatvatugayatāḥ || yasya 
yogamārgasya ādhārāñjanena udakaṃ bhramayati || gṛhavat || lakṣajaptvā 
bhavedyogī sayogī bhairavaḥ svayam | atyuṣṭakoṭibhairavāni tasya romakūpe 
vyavasthitāni || athavāṣṭasahasrāṇi japtavyāni ca bhairavī | eka eva hi japtavyo 
dhyātvā raktāni bhairavī || evaṃ caiva mahāsiddhi vācayā sādhakasya tu | <p. 
29b> likhanāt paṭhanārambhe kaścijīvaṃ nahanyate | 

likhanaṃ ca bhaveddevī madyaraktālake ca na | 
bhairavasya ca bījaṃ ca carcikāraktameva ca || 

māyābījayuge naiva pratyuce yogamārabhet || ||

ekākīnirjane vāpi madyābhiṣiktaśaṃkhamālayā | 
japato yasyamākhyātaṃ bhairavānāmaśeṣataḥ || 

sandhyayāmvāni nāyāmbā kartavyaṃ japamuttamam | 
aṣṭamyāmvā caturdaśyāṃ pūjyapustakayatnataḥ || 

ārāme tu prakartavyā tathaivābhyāṃ prayatnataḥ || 
advaitācārabhāva sadāyogīlīlakrutamupasthi(?)tām || ||

atha nīlakarpaṭayugale naparidhāye muktakeśaraktāṃgarāge madirānandena japet 
|| <p. 30a> śaktisanarddha advaitācāreṇa sākṣāt bhairavo bhavet || ||

atha saptadaśījāpene acirādbhairavo bhavet || ṣoḍaśākṣarajāpena 
puraścaraṇavālatrayena rātrau siddhi parāguṃṭhitaśarīraṃtaratareṇacāreṇa 
sarvaśāstrādīn dhārayet | smaramātreṇa yuddhe tasya kopi purato na tiṣṭen || 
vyāghrabhallukadhukkuśca veṣṭikana śiva huṃ kusumayutāṃ paragṛhamukhe 
prakṣipye paśurūpaṃ karoti | atyaṃ vacanaśca gomāyumārjāri śivasya vācāri 
raktena peṣayet || anena sahāṃ japet || dviṣadravyamapaharati | paragṛhe sarvaṃ 
paśyati || adṛśyo bhavati || <p. 30b> athavā guṭikāmukheṣṭhe na sivarasanā 
cchāgarasanā pītakapilāyā kṣirapiṣṭhalepayet || agni staṃbhayati || ||

mārjāraraktāṃ yuktāyāṃ guḍikāmukhe prakṣipya śvetamāṇḍakacūrṇasya 
raktena bhāvitā cāṇḍālirakena miśritena udake vilālanetre vaśāraktamiśritam || 
adṛśaṃ bhavati | tasyā raktena yaṃ likhyati taṃ karoti || tasyā bhāgena 
sahamarddha akṣayaṃ bhavati | madyaraktādi śmasānasūtreṇa vadhvā hastena 
vātasya śvetena pītena raktenājayet | savirūpā bhavati || || 

kapālacūrṇamastake deyaṃ virūpo bhavati || siddhidā uttamottame ṇe ete 
sadāsiddhiprayogaḥ || <p. 31> gopitavyāni bhairavī | namantrayāti 
cānyamantrasahasreṣu uktādyute || siddhidā uttamottamena nirmitāḥ || ||

śrībhairava uvāca ||

śṛṇu bhairavi deveśī sarvapāpavināsanam |
lokapāpavināsārtha hṛdi kṛtān stri te(?) guru bhairavāntikaṃ naśāstraṃ svayaṃ 
vāpi nārācāgrathārthameva ca || ekākṣarā dvi(-)catu(-)paṃca(-)ṣaṭ(-)
saptākṣarādiraktā natejānatti sapāpimāḥ pathitā siddhimicchanti 
aṣṭamahāsiddhi kṣaṇādapi kathyante || ||

asiddhyante pāpapiṇḍayojitāḥ || || 

mālāmantramahādevī śīghraśiddhi phalapradā |
<p. 31b> abhyāsena mahādevī janakoṭiśatena ca |

ekākṣarā nasiddhyanti śatābhyāsaviyogataḥ ||
tena siddhyana deveśi sākṣā sabhairavo bhavet || 

ekākṣaraḥ saptalakṣaiḥ siddhirbha (*) tisarvadā ||
paṃcākṣaro ṣoḍaśalakṣairnavākṣarā navarakṣaiḥ || 

ṣoḍaśāḥkṣarāḥ saptalakṣaiḥ || ||

