catuścatvāriṃśākṣarā sa evalakṣaiḥ || 

navabhyākṣarā catullakṣaiḥ || ||

śatākṣarā trirākṣarā jāpyi || ||

paṃcaśatākṣarālakṣadvayena || ||

<p. 32a> sahasrākṣaro mahāmālā lakṣaiḥ || puraścaraṇa siddhirbhavati || 
brahmacaryanaraiḥ kṛtvā saṃkṣayā catuguṇānyeva kalaukartavyā niśāyāṃ 
śaktisaṃnaddho bhūtvā madirānandanandita samuktakeśo bhūtvā sapaṃcakena 
vāmathavā vāmapathena puraścaryāṃ kṛtvā yathoktasaṃkhyayā puraścaryāṃ 
siddhirbhavati || ekākṣarāḥ dvitṛcatuḥpaṃcaṣaṭsaptādiraktā natejānantimantra sa 
yā yāpināḥ paṭhita siddhimicchanti || mahāṣṭasiddhirlabhante || 
yāvatpūrvajanmārjitapāpapiṇḍa tāvannasiddhyati || puraścaraṇa jāpena 
pāpanāśo siddhirbhavati | 

mahāmālā mahādevi śīghrasiddhipradāyakā | 
abhyāsana mahādevī janmakoṭi gataṃ (*) (*) || 

<p. 32b> ekākṣarā nasiddhyaṃti śatābhyāsaṃ prayogatā|
tena siddhyati deveśi sākṣāt cchivasamo bhavet |

mālāmantraṃ mahādevī sighrasiddhiphalapradā |

tyena vijñātamātreṇa yogītridaśahā bhavet | 
etat jñātvā prayatnena guhyacaṇḍī maheśvarī | 

sadāsiddhipradā kālī gurupādaprasādataḥ || 
granthān sarvān parityajya sarvayogān vratāni ca ||

mantrān sarvān parityajya kālikāmantramācaret || ||

kalau tu kālikāmantraṃ siddhisanti śivājñayā ||
niṣkillikā mahāvidyā dikpālapadabhāgpradaḥ || 

ye atra yuktāṃ deveśi mantrau bhairavabhāṣitā | 
teṣāntavākyamātreṇa trailokya sakṣayaṃ bhavet || ||

phreṁ namo guhyakālike hana (2) huṁ (2) phaṭ || 

