etadviśeṣakaraṃ devī mūlamantrasya bhairavī ||

sarvāmnāyaparaṃ devī kālikāguhyanirmitā || ||

oṃ phreṁ siddhi hskhphreṁ shkhphreṁ khphreṁ kalāli khphreṁ hskhphreṁ khpreṁ phreṁ oṃ 
