<p. 34a> devāśca grahanāgāśca sarvate ājñā siddhikarī siddhi tasya siddhi 
maheśvari || ete viśeṣakarī deva (devī??) prakāsya ca maheśvarī lakṣajāpya na 
pūrvajanmārjitakaluṣaṃ dahet | dvitīya lakṣena viśuddho bhavati || ||

tṛtīye na devyā saṃnidhānam || || 

caturthena samarasam || ||

paṃcameṇamantraṃ prajvaret || ||

ṣallakṣeṇasiddhirbhavati || || 

tato yatheṣṭena mantraṃ kārayet || ||

oṃ phreṁ jāmahadehapacamānamāṭaya ānaya gṛhnaya veddhā carvadajalpa 
cānyapraviśya || marmeti ca sā sarvaṃ karoti || paṃcalakṣeṇasarvayoginīnāṃ 
pūjanīyo bhavati || ṣaṣṭhe rudrātmanām | <p. 34b> navame mahābhairava || 
koṭīnāṃ sarvajñā sadāśiva bhavantīti || evaṃ jāpena sarvaṃ karoti || ||

cinmaṃtracistā tuhyayogāllakṣajāpena sarvasiddhyaṃti na saṃśaya || evaṃ 
jāpyam || yāvanmanośuddhirbhavati || tāvanmantrasiddhi kuruto bhavati || 
karmakāṇḍamānāṃ pūjādināmā hi tān vavalokānte tatra caṇḍi na paṭhati || 
punasiddhirbhavati micchati | pāpakarmasya kuto siddhi bhavati || kālikāyā mayā 
proktā mantraṃ paṭhitasiddhidā | kuto'nyatra siddhi || ||

kalauyuge mahādevi jāpyanasiddhyate kramāt || kṣudrakarmāṇi paṭhitamātrena 
siddhyati || kintena kṣudrakarmāṇā pāpakāriṇa hetu || || 

tataḥ śrīguhyakālikā avasya siddhidā || ||

<p. 35a> tato'nte ṇirvāṇamantrāḥ kathitāḥ || || 

