kasyāpi kathānīyaṃ gopanīyaṃ prayatnataḥ | agniguhyā bhrāmitavyo 
maṇḍalāditāyoge tathaiva ca mahāmāṃse homāt || <p. 35b> mānasopacāreṇa 
sarvaṃ siddhyati || bhairavaṃ bhavati || ||

kriyā mantrādikaṃ sarvaṃ karmaṇimānasena aruṇodaye siddhyati || 
māṃsayuktaṃ dhūpena māṃsahomena hantavyānitiniścaya kriyātantre || ||

śrīdevyuvāca || 

