krodhasvabhāvam | hṛdayaṃ spṛśati saṃvoṣam || jānuṃ spṛśati || 
lalāṭaskandhaṃ hṛdaya spṛśati | mā bhaiṣī vadati | ekāṃgulaṃ tarjanīṃ 
darśayati || kupitākāram | nāsikāṃ saṃkocayati || atrā sūcī vartate || 
abhivādayati || pratyabhivādane || kapālamudrāṃ darśayati || mauliṃ spṛśati 
icchārūpaṃ karoti || mahāṃkuśamudrāṃ darśayati || kāryasiddhi || 
khaḍgamudrā abhiṣṭarābha || kṛtāṃjalimudrā prārthayati || kapālamudrā 
vāruṇīṃ pivāmi || urddhaṃ leveti || kiṃ prajāmi || daṃṣṭrāṃ darśayati | 
mahāśamayāṃ kurute bhṛkutiṃ dhārayati | śiraścārayati || <p. 54a> mayātvaṃ 
bhakṣayāmite || draṣṭrā kiṭikipayate | tvayāmayi aparādhakṛdaṃ hastaṃ 
mārjayati | mayā bhakṣakartavyaṃ hūṃkāraṃ darśayati || neṣadhayati | 
digāvalokayati | pheṁkāramudrāṃ daśayati || tava bhadraṃ bhadraṃ bhaviṣyati | 
vāhudvalālayati | tvāṃ rakṣayāmi || nuṭha lālayati || cūṣayāmi || 
locanācūllālayati || tvayāhaṃ paraśī kṛtaḥ || mukhaṃ pāṭayati || abhaktositi | 
cakṣunmīlayati || mama śarīrābhāvikosīti || nāśā śrotā spṛśati | 
gandhapuṣpadhūpaṃ dehīti || pṛṣṭhaṃ pṛśati śayāmīti || triśūramudrāṃ 
darśayati āgatosmīti || rudrāṇī aṃguṣṭhaṃ darśayati | brahmāṇī 
padmamudrayā || rudrāṇī aṃguṣṭhena || <p. 54b> vaiṣṇavī vāmamadhyamayā || 
rudrāṇī aṃguṣṭhena || vaiṣṇavī vāmamadhyamayā | indrāṇī anāmikā || 
kaumārī kaniṣṭhikā cālena || lakṣmī yonimudrayā || vārāhī daṃṣṭākalālayati 
|| ||

cāmuṇḍā oṣṭhalelihyate jihvayā || nakhāgra nabhūmiṃ spṛti | tava iṣṭaviyogo 
bhavati || ||

vāmahastena bhūmiṃ tādayati || tava mṛtyubhaviṣyati hastamuttārayati || 
tavaśatrurnāśayati || pāśvāvalokādajito bhavati || dakṣamullāśayati | nirjanaṃ 
bhavati | aṃgadhūtvā nātvāṃ natyājayāmiti | jihvā lālayati | tava vāṃcchā 
pūrṇayāmi || citraṃ lagnāti || abhayanabhayaṃ nāsti | citraradarśayati | 
prasannayati || <p. 55a> cidratnamudrayā prasannam || 

vamaṇe pārthitasaṃpradattam || 

abhayena tava bhayaṃ nāstī evaṃ āveśe kumārī pūjāyāṃpimudrayā bhadrā 
bhadranidāna || 

karmoloparikaṃ kapālācaraṇastha guhyajapa mahāsiddhisādhane yatheṣṭacārī || 

icchārūpeṇa nānācarusādhanī bhavati || 

kālipecikā yanauraktapittameva ca || 
aṃjanenāṃjayet | adṛśyakaraṇaṃ paraṃ || 

nānārūpa icchābhimantrītaṃ cāṇḍāliraktamiśritena 
sahasrāṇādravyamapaharati | 

adṛśya na paragṛhaṃ praveśayati || 

yathecchayā śastraśāstrādayo bhavati || 

guḍikāmukhe kanakena veṣṭitā cāṇḍālī prathamakusumaṃ ca paśyakāvapasya 
tatvaṃ <p. 55b> kṣatropakṣatra svayaṃ pīṭhopapīṭha adha(-)ūrddhameva ca || 

ātmānaṃ sarvapīṭhamayaṃ devī dhyāyat tasmādātmaprabhaṃ svayaṃ pūjayet 
|| 

nānādevaganāsarve nānāgandharvakojñeyan nānānācādya nānācarupūjā 
śobhitām || 

nānā śāstrayogāntaramantra nānārūpatayā taruṇī vilāsinī yutā || 

hṛdaye cintayet || 

kailāśaṃ aṣṭakulaparvatam || 

samudrapātālanānājīvagaṇā samākīrṇasaṃcintayet | yathāsukhaṃ 
sarvalokapālātmā tṛbhairavān sarvapathivyapete || 

śaivāyurākāśameva cintayet || 

yathā yatra yukta yathā yaṃ pūjayet || 

ātmānaṃ sarvamayaṃ cintayet || 

adhogatāṃ sarvāmyasya saṃbhramahatāṃ bhayākulā <p. 59> 
aṇekapraharaṇavarjitām | abrāhmaṇaṃ kurvatāṃ mūrcchitāścintanīyā || || 

oṃ hrīṁ hraiṁ phreṁ phaṭ nādagarjitāṃ jvālājvalitātmikāḥ || 

mahākrodhākulām || 

dhyātavyā devasarvāśca dūtīkāśca ātmānaṃ evaṃ dhyātavyaṃ yogendra na 
tu sarvadā || 

etāste kathitāḥ samādhayaḥ || || 

hanaḥ huṃ phaṭkālabhāvanāt || eṣā kālikā siddhi bhairavī māranātmakā 
gopitavyā || prayatnena yogindrena sarvadā || gopite ca mahāsiddhi jāyate acirādapi 
|| yallokaviruddhaṃ tat sarvayatnena gopitavyā || eṣā guhyā parā guhyā guhya ca tu 
parāparam | parasiṣyena dātavyaṃ devatāmantrameva ca ||
na śrāvayanmantrapūjāṃ paraśi(----------------)

